    "long_instructions": "Use **PAIR Programming with AI** to help manage your postings:\r\n\r\n* **Prompt:** Ask AI to generate or explain a helper.\r\n\r\n* **Analyze:** Compare two possible versions or lines of code.\r\n\r\n* **Integrate:** Implement and test in the display.\r\n\r\n* **Reflect:** Write a short statement about how helper functions protect data consistency in *reflection.md*\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### 🔴 Going Live Now!\r\n**Status:** Urgent Update\r\n\r\n**Details:** You just woke up feeling lucky. You decided to do a surprise speedrun attempt right now (Monday slot) to try for a World Record.\r\n\r\n**Action Required:** Add this alert to the very **start** of your feed so it's the first thing subscribers see.\r\n\r\n* **Title:** \"Surprise Speedrun\"\r\n* **Content:** \"Attempting a World Record run live!\"\r\n* **Image:** \"speedrun.jpg\"",
